sect1.para:
  foreach construct ले arrays र objects मा iterate गर्न सजिलो उपाय प्रदान गर्दछ।
  अन्य कुनै data type भएको variable वा initialize नभएको variable मा foreach प्रयोग गर्दा यसले error दिन्छ।


    foreach ले वैकल्पिक रूपमा प्रत्येक element को key पनि लिन सक्छ:



foreach (iterable_expression as $value) {
    statement_list
}

foreach (iterable_expression as $key => $value) {
    statement_list
}

sect1.example:
  foreach का सामान्य प्रयोगहरू


<?php

echo "Value only\n";
$array = [1, 2, 3, 17];

foreach ($array as $value) {
    echo "Current element of \$array: $value.\n";
}

echo "\n\nKey and value:\n";
$array = [
    "one" => 1,
    "two" => 2,
    "three" => 3,
    "seventeen" => 17
];

foreach ($array as $key => $value) {
    echo "Key: $key => Value: $value\n";
}

echo "\n\nMulti-dimensional key-value arrays:\n";
$grid = [];
$grid[0][0] = "a";
$grid[0][1] = "b";
$grid[1][0] = "y";
$grid[1][1] = "z";

foreach ($grid as $y => $row) {
    foreach ($row as $x => $value) {
        echo "Value at position x=$x and y=$y: $value\n";
    }
}

echo "\n\nDynamic arrays:\n";
foreach (range(1, 5) as $value) {
    echo "$value\n";
}
?>


  &example.outputs;


Value only
Current element of $array: 1.
Current element of $array: 2.
Current element of $array: 3.
Current element of $array: 17.


Key and value:
Key: one => Value: 1
Key: two => Value: 2
Key: three => Value: 3
Key: seventeen => Value: 17


Multi-dimensional key-value arrays:
Value at position x=0 and y=0: a
Value at position x=1 and y=0: b
Value at position x=0 and y=1: y
Value at position x=1 and y=1: z


Dynamic arrays:
1
2
3
4
5

para.informalexample:

     तलका दुवै उदाहरणमा $a मा nested array को पहिलो element र $b मा दोस्रो element रहनेछ:



<?php
$array = [
    [1, 2],
    [3, 4],
];

foreach ($array as [$a, $b]) {
    echo "A: $a; B: $b\n";
}

foreach ($array as list($a, $b)) {
    echo "A: $a; B: $b\n";
}
?>


    &example.outputs;


A: 1; B: 2
A: 3; B: 4
A: 1; B: 2
A: 3; B: 4

sect2.para:
   Array मा भएका elements भन्दा थोरै variables दिइयो भने बाँकी elements लाई बेवास्ता (ignore) गरिन्छ।
   त्यसै गरी, comma प्रयोग गरेर बीचका elements लाई छोड्न (skip गर्न) सकिन्छ:



<?php
$array = [
    [1, 2, 5],
    [3, 4, 6],
];

foreach ($array as [$a, $b]) {
    // यहाँ $c नभएको ध्यान दिनुहोस्।
    echo "$a $b\n";
}

foreach ($array as [, , $c]) {
    // $a र $b लाई छोड्दै
    echo "$c\n";
}
?>


    &example.outputs;


1 2
3 4
5
6

   यदि list भर्नका लागि पर्याप्त array elements छैनन् भने notice उत्पन्न हुनेछ:




<?php
$array = [
    [1, 2],
    [3, 4],
];

foreach ($array as [$a, $b, $c]) {
    echo "A: $a; B: $b; C: $c\n";
}
?>


    &example.outputs;


Notice: Undefined offset: 2 in example.php on line 7
A: 1; B: 2; C:

Notice: Undefined offset: 2 in example.php on line 7
A: 3; B: 4; C:

   Loop भित्र प्रत्यक्ष रूपमा array elements परिमार्जन गर्न $value को अगाडि & राख्न सकिन्छ।
   त्यस्तो अवस्थामा value reference द्वारा assign हुनेछ।



<?php
$arr = [1, 2, 3, 4];
foreach ($arr as &$value) {
    $value = $value * 2;
}
// $arr अब [2, 4, 6, 8] हुन्छ
var_dump($arr);
unset($value); // अन्तिम element सँगको reference तोड्नुहोस्
?>


    &example.outputs;


array(4) {
  [0]=>
  int(2)
  [1]=>
  int(4)
  [2]=>
  int(6)
  [3]=>
  &int(8)
}

sect2.example:
  Constant array का values लाई reference द्वारा iterate गर्ने


<?php
foreach ([1, 2, 3, 4] as &$value) {
    $value = $value * 2;
    echo $value . "\n";
}
?>


   &example.outputs;


2
4
6
8
